      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "Fixes the two `sp(KEY,KEY)` extended key examples:\n\n- The watch-only example's scan `xprv` was at the account level, so it could derive the spend private key, and its spend `xpub.../0h` required hardened derivation from a public key.\n- Neither example used the BIP352 child paths (`1h/0` scan, `0h/0` spend).\n\nThe watch-only example now places the scan `xprv` at `.../1h` and the spend `xpub` at `.../0h`. The full-wallet example uses the account `xprv` with `/1h/0` and `/0h/0`.",
